"description":"Stay effortlessly connected to your loved ones with Scout: Family Location 360, the trusted GPS family tracker and location sharing app designed for real-time visibility, peace of mind, and safety on the road. \n\nWhether you’re checking if your kids made it to school, coordinating with a spouse, or monitoring your teen’s driving habits, Scout makes it simple to track, share, and stay informed.\n\n\n\nLive Location Sharing 360 & Real-Time GPS Tracker\nTrack your family’s live location on a real-time map using our advanced GPS tracker. Scout provides accurate, up-to-date positioning so you always know where your loved ones are -no more guessing or constant texting. Scout doubles as a family location tracker, ensuring the safety of your loved ones. Stay connected and worry-free with improved accuracy for all your Location Sharing needs.\n\n\n\nFamily Location & Place Alerts\nGet instant notifications when family members arrive at or leave key locations like home, school, or work. Set up custom location alerts and receive real-time updates to help keep everyone in sync.\n\n\n\nFind Family & Friends Location Instantly\nUse our enhanced 360 Locator to quickly see everyone’s location at a glance. Need to see someone in person? Our new feature lets you instantly start navigation to any family member's location - right within the Scout app. Just tap and go!\n\n\n\nDriving Safety Insights & Child Safety Reports\nScout Family Location 360 acts as a powerful child safety app, helping parents monitor teen drivers. Track speeding, hard braking, acceleration, and phone use behind the wheel. Get alerted to critical safety events.\n\n\n\nWeekly Driving Reports\nStay informed with automatic weekly driving reports that show trip history, behavior trends, and safety scores. Use this data to coach safer driving and recognize improvement.\n\n\n\nVisual Status Indicators\nQuickly check who’s at home, at work, or driving with status icons displayed next to each family member’s avatar, making it easier than ever to stay in the loop.\n\n\n\nLocation History and Safety Tracking\nReview past trips or verify locations anytime. Scout: Family Location Sharing keeps secure location history for each family member, giving you peace of mind and visibility over time.\n\nWhy Families Choose Scout\n•\tBuilt for modern families who want reliable GPS location sharing\n•\tCombines live tracking, place alerts, and driving safety in one app\n•\tHelps parents stay connected to kids and teens on the move\n•\tEasy to use, beautifully designed, and privacy-first\n•\tNavigate directly to family members when needed\n\nHave feedback or questions? Email us at scout@telenav.com — we’d love to hear from you.\n\nThank you for being with Scout: Family Location 360!\n\n\n\nPlease keep in mind:\nContinued use of GPS running in the background can decrease battery life.\nScout’s map and search coverage are currently for the USA only.", "trackCensoredName":"Scout: Family Location 360", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/scout-family-location-360/id467816643?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.4900000000000002131628207280300557613372802734375, "minimumOsVersion":"14.0", "userRatingCount":6751}, 
