"releaseNotes":"This update fixes the problems many of you wrote to us about.\n\n• Your language is back: Family Nest follows your iPhone's language again.\n• A crash when opening the app from a notification is fixed.\n• Places you delete stay deleted, and places show again right after you unlock your phone.\n• Arrival and leave alerts follow your edits: move or resize a place and alerts use the new area straight away.\n• Drive alerts are off unless you want them. Turn them on in Nest Drive or Settings, quietly or with sound.\n• Speeding drives are no longer shared with nests you have paused.\n• Uses much less mobile data in the background.\n\nThank you for your feedback. We read every message.", "version":"2.8.1", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"Know your family made it — to school, to work, back home — without a single \"where are you?\" text.\n\nFamily Nest shows the people you choose on a private, real-time map. Trusted by thousands of families with a 4.7-star rating. (Formerly Family360 — same app, new name, and Circles are now called Nests.)\n\nFREE FOR EVERYONE\n• Create private Nests and chat with the people who matter most\n• See your family on the live map — always with their consent\n• Share your live location on trips and commutes so loved ones know you're safe\n• Place alerts for Home, School, and Work — know the moment someone arrives or leaves\n• Overspeed alerts to help guide safer driving habits\n• Phone locator — find your own lost or misplaced phone\n\nPREMIUM — FOR MORE CONTROL\n• Real-time tracking with ETA — accurate updates with routes and arrival times\n• 365 days of location history — look back at daily routes and movements\n• Statistics view — understand travel patterns and activity trends\n• Unlimited places with entry/exit alerts\n• Priority customer support\n\nWHY FAMILIES CHOOSE FAMILY NEST\nYour location is shared only with people you trust, inside your Nest. We don't sell your data — Premium subscriptions are our only revenue. Ever.\n\nMADE FOR REAL LIFE\nParents & kids: know they reached school or practice safely. New drivers: overspeed alerts encourage better habits. Couples: share the drive home. Elderly care: gentle arrival and departure alerts. Travel groups: stay together in new places. And when your own phone goes missing — find it instantly.\n\nPRIVACY FIRST\nFamily Nest is not a spying tool. Location sharing always requires consent and can be paused anytime. Our mission is keeping families connected without compromising trust.\n\nTry it free, or unlock Premium for the full experience.\n\nTerms of Service: https://www.familynestapp.com/terms-of-service\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.familynestapp.com/privacy-policy", "trackCensoredName":"Family Nest - Family Locator", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/family-nest-family-locator/id1537446782?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.6650299999999997879740476491861045360565185546875, "minimumOsVersion":"15.0", "userRatingCount":38607}]
